@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@
 - The `stale_hours` setting defaults to 24 hours instead of 48.
 - Parcels over 25 kg pay the new `overweight` surcharge (18.00) instead of `oversize`, which now
   covers only parcels with a side longer than 100 cm.
+- Declared values up to 5000.00 are accepted, up from 2500.00.
 
